DCBAD"}, {"file_name": "Untitled design (12).png", "id": "993994850150113", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307339_993994853483446_1187314442911025361_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R59wxd7DdcgQ7kNvwFN0F_7&_nc_oc=Adrpd9Ecvq9VGF9iBIUtiUAv0O5nI053YOvx_u4Q0jy1jQdup-Bg9DUxTOrRctoD8do&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRG3Tnm3idW2MrLgPh_okek60eSdBk84GITf7QBrkD5Kg&oe=6AFDB599"}, {"file_name": "Untitled design (13).png", "id": "1185895656771360", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300897_1185895660104693_1586407616411657046_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_Sto1zhlnUoQ7kNvwECnodQ&_nc_oc=AdqhH9EHB5B6ZgM2PN9Yi5Rn0JmNsglpgBUiKsjvJf3OK6Mvw7URlUaNqDvEF40pirM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQjrMk47oDPB4WY_MNtcwJcfn9v5xAsLbCly5ai352-4A&oe=6AFDBC2E"}, {"file_name": "Untitled design (14).png", "id": "26507286155543160", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300678_26507286172209825_5695452597013670875_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZbqsVx0CT8sQ7kNvwF8p4Vo&_nc_oc=AdrJ9-C4ne7jYotWsuIKEfAqVPtVeX00vh1irfS3hG9BEhCtRkgS_86m4e89jJ7cnAE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR1JKMzE2W1h_0Bxw8RTS8HGw_RsPwa4Y_VnDVffK8QdQ&oe=6AFDD135"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled design (4).png", "id": "1344230044390345", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307315_1344230051057011_9037583091754755675_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6a2R0_Pc1mMQ7kNvwEwTM7-&_nc_oc=Ado4KqR5lvl4A1hpuat2ymM8X8NWNN1MJ3xIF0TdJ3H3nNjS_5irHzYgRUZySgVnLIY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR9LZvvg05rJjFppl90vrHKUPfaG60a4PO0jqrS6nakYA&oe=6AFDB2AD"}, "display_name": "canopyXchaos", "keywords": [], "long_description": ". Refined Locomotion & Physics\nThe \"feel\" of a Gtag-style game is everything. Even if your movement is solid, constant updates are needed to:\n\nSurface-Specific Friction: Adding \"slippery\" ice walls, \"sticky\" honey or mud, and high-bounce trampolines to change how players navigate.\n\nHaptic Feedback Calibration: Fine-tuning the rumble in the controllers so every \"slap\" and \"jump\" feels impactful and distinct.\n\nCollision Optimization: Fixing those pesky spots where players get their hands stuck in a wall or \"clip\" through the floor.\n\n\ud83e\udde5 2. The Cosmetic & Economy Loop\nIf you want players to keep coming back, they need a reason to \"show off.\"\n\nSeasonal Item Rotations: Introducing limited-time hats, badges, or handheld items tied to real-world holidays (Halloween, Winter, Summer) or in-game \"lore\" events.\n\nPlayer Tiers & Rarity: Implementing \"OG\" badges for early supporters or \"Veteran\" skins that can only be earned through playtime, not just currency.\n\nParticle Effects: Adding \"trails\" or \"glows\" to high-tier items to make them true status symbols in the lobby.\n\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f 3. Map Expansion & \"Biome\" Variety\nDon't just add more space; add more variety to the gameplay.\n\nVerticality-Focused Maps: Creating a \"Canyon\" or \"Skyscraper\" map that rewards high-risk jumps and punishes players who fall.\n\nDynamic Environments: Adding moving platforms, rising lava, or water mechanics (swimming is a huge trend in Gtag-likes!) to keep the \"taggers\" on their toes.\n\nThe \"Hub\" Evolution: Constantly updatin", "short_description": "This is a Gtag fangame with some ongoing updates in the works.....always"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1DC1ngVpjsW-XYcvzW7hZn4LY2SLLMiDjrZ92qKT1OXM/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RNG", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.you